  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 405.06 Inspection Frequency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 405.06 Inspection Frequency. The frequency of inspections for construction and reconstruction projects shall be as frequent as needed to ensure compliance with approved plans and specifications and in accordance with the requirements of the approved construction inspection plan.\n\nSource. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
